Package: offensiveline
Type: Package
Title: Sleeper Fantasy Football League Analytics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Trevor", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "trevor@example.com")
Description: Tools for extracting, transforming, and analyzing Sleeper fantasy
    football league data. Provides ETL functions, leaderboard calculations,
    matchup analytics, best-ball analysis, award generation, and JSON
    serialization for consumption by the theoffensiveline-site web app.
